{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18866","headline":"忆春草 · 刘禹锡","name":"忆春草","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆春草，处处多情洛阳道。\n金谷园中见日迟，铜驼陌上迎风早。\n河南大尹频出难，只得池塘十步看。\n府门闭後满街月，几处游人草头歇。\n馆娃宫外姑苏台，郁郁芊芊拨不开。\n无风自偃君知否，西子帬裾曾拂来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18866.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18866","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}